WEBVTT

16:33.435 --> 16:35.354
What did I buy you for?

16:35.479 --> 16:38.649
- To make me sad?
- No, Your Grace.

16:39.817 --> 16:43.028
To, uh, teach your sister.

16:43.153 --> 16:46.156
To teach my sister how
to be a better lover?

16:46.282 --> 16:49.451
You think I bought you
to make Khal Drogo happy?

16:53.998 --> 16:56.875
Oh, you pretty little idiot.

16:57.001 --> 16:58.794
(CHUCKLES)

16:58.919 --> 17:01.005
Go on, then.
Get on with it.
